---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { sitio } from '../../contenido/sitio.es';
import { identidadLegal } from '../../contenido/pendientes';

const actualizado = '2 September 2026';
---

<Base
  titulo="Privacy policy | NovuChat"
  descripcion="What data we handle, what for, who we share it with and how to exercise your rights."
  rutaAlterna="/privacidad"
>
  <section class="seccion">
    <div class="contenedor" style="max-width: var(--ancho-lectura)">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="texto-apagado">Last updated: {actualizado}</p>
      <p class="texto-apagado">
        This is a translation for convenience. In case of discrepancy, the
        <a href="/privacidad">Spanish version</a> prevails.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      {
        identidadLegal ? (
          <p>
            The controller of your data is <strong>{identidadLegal.razonSocial}</strong>,
            tax ID {identidadLegal.nit}, based in {sitio.contacto.ciudad}, Bolivia.
          </p>
        ) : (
          <aside class="card elev-sm" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--color-aviso)">
            <p class="card-kicker" style="color: var(--color-aviso)">Pending registration</p>
            <p class="card-body">
              NovuChat's registered name and tax ID are being issued and will be
              published here as soon as they are. In the meantime, the controller
              of your data answers at{' '}
              <a href={`mailto:${sitio.contacto.correo}`}>{sitio.contacto.correo}</a>{' '}
              and on WhatsApp {sitio.contacto.whatsapp}, in {sitio.contacto.ciudad}, Bolivia.
            </p>
          </aside>
        )
      }

      <h2>2. What data we handle</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>If you use the form:</strong> your name, your business name, your
        industry, your city, your WhatsApp number, your email and whatever you
        write in the message.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>If you use the site assistant:</strong> the text of the
        conversation, the language, the page you wrote from and a technical
        identifier that cannot be traced back to your identity.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Measurement:</strong> if you accept the measurement notice, Google
        Analytics and the Meta pixel record which pages you visited and where you
        came from, with their own cookies. If you decline, neither is loaded and
        no third-party cookie is written.
      </p>

      <h2>3. The assistant is an artificial intelligence</h2>
      <p>
        It is not a person, and it says so if asked. Replies are generated with
        third-party models (Google Gemini and Anthropic Claude). Your message is
        sent to the provider solely to generate the reply and, under those
        providers' API terms, is not used to train their models. Do not write
        passwords, card numbers or sensitive data in the chat.
      </p>

      <h2>4. What we use it for</h2>
      <p>
        To reply to you, arrange a demo, prepare a proposal and improve the
        assistant. We do not sell or trade your data.
      </p>

      <h2>5. If you are a customer of a business using NovuChat</h2>
      <p>
        When you message a business that works with us, <strong>that business is
        the controller of your data</strong>. NovuChat acts as processor and
        follows its instructions. The channel is Meta's WhatsApp Business Cloud
        API. The assistant identifies itself as an AI and can hand you over to a
        person. To stop receiving messages, reply <strong>BAJA</strong> or block
        the number. Demonstration charges are always labelled as simulated.
      </p>

      <h2>6. How we protect your data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>All traffic is encrypted, with secure connection enforced in the browser.</li>
        <li>Data is stored encrypted on Google Cloud infrastructure.</li>
        <li>Every request is verified to tell a person from a bot.</li>
        <li>Rate limits prevent abuse of the assistant.</li>
        <li>No browser can reach our database: everything goes through our servers.</li>
        <li>Technical logs never store your email or phone number in the clear.</li>
        <li>Each business is isolated from the others, with rules tested automatically on every change.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>
        Google Cloud and Firebase (hosting, database, anti-fraud verification),
        our transactional email provider, the AI model providers (the query text
        only), Meta Platforms when the conversation happens on WhatsApp, Google
        and Meta if you accepted measurement, and the competent authority upon a
        legal request. Our servers are located in the United States.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask for access, correction or deletion of your data, and withdraw
        your consent at any time. Write to{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${sitio.contacto.correo}`}>{sitio.contacto.correo}</a>{' '}
        and we reply within fifteen business days.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Assistant conversations and technical logs are deleted after ninety days.
        Contact details are kept while a commercial relationship exists or until
        you ask us to delete them.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Changes and applicable law</h2>
      <p>
        If we change this policy we update the date above. It is governed by the
        laws of the Plurinational State of Bolivia.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
